    "ciesin:tags": "Country, State, County, Population, Society, Earth Science, Human Dimensions",
    "ciesin:nasa_doi": "10.7927/H41V5BWK",
    "ciesin:sedac_doi": "10.7927/H41V5BWK",
    "ciesin:purpose": "To provide US housing and related data for demographic analysis; The samples can be extended to analysis of the whole United States for many purposes. Comparative analysis across different groups is possible using the PUMS data.",
